## Signals for State (REQUIRED)

```typescript
readonly count = signal(0);
readonly doubled = computed(() => this.count() * 2);

// Update
this.count.set(5);
this.count.update(prev => prev + 1);

// Side effects
effect(() => localStorage.setItem('count', this.count().toString()));
